而非后期叠加。输出最高可达 2K 分辨率、24fps，时长最长约 15 秒。\n\n## 关于本工作流\n\n本模板运行 **图像转视频** 任务（`MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` 节点），涵盖以下两种模式：\n\n- **t2va**（文本转视频）：未连接图像时使用\n- **fl2va**（首帧/尾帧图像转视频）：连接 `first_frame` 和/或 `last_frame` 时使用\n\n**关键输入参数**\n\n- **first_frame / last_frame**：可选关键帧，模型生成两者之间的运动画面\n- **prompt**：在一个文本块中统一描述镜头、运动以及配套的音频（对话、音效、音乐）\n- **width / height**：通过分辨率选择器设置。H3 的原生画布短边为 768px，上限为 768×1344 像素，并取整到 32 的倍数\n- **duration (seconds)**：由数学表达式节点转换为有效的帧数 `length`，按 24fps 向上对齐到模型每块 17 帧（17k+5）的网格"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 630], "pos": [-1182.5982666015625, 4459.58984375], "id": 116, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [265], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "type"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [640, 120], "pos": [-683.6655883789062, 4706.3193359375], "id": 130, "properties": {"models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors", "directory": "text_encoders", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors"}], "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [230, 266], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors"]